WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Share selected references — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:10.084
Ask Vera to prepare a draft from your saved peer references.

2
00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:16.707
In the reference draft, choose who to include.

3
00:00:16.707 --> 00:00:26.323
Remove anyone who should not be in this request, then check the remaining names and contact details.

4
00:00:26.323 --> 00:00:33.007
Copy draft prepares text for you to paste.

5
00:00:33.007 --> 00:00:39.046
Open in email opens your mail app.

6
00:00:39.046 --> 00:00:45.016
Neither choice sends the message for you.

7
00:00:45.016 --> 00:00:51.800
Review the recipient before completing delivery.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
